<article class="panel extension-form"><h2>Live response</h2><p id="bb-status" role="status">Loading…</p><div class="bb-metrics"><div><small>CODE EVALUATIONS</small><strong id="bb-evals">0</strong></div><div><small>FLUX OFFSET</small><strong id="bb-offset">0</strong></div><div><small>CHIRAL GAIN</small><strong id="bb-gain">1</strong></div></div><pre id="bb-tick" class="bb-output"></pre><p>Control code responds once a second; the existing pulse applies its bounded influence. Your pause controls and original rules remain authoritative. Restart returns this process to paused.</p><p>General source repairs are saved as drafts. Active pure functions can compute new reports and choose permitted bit rotations; they cannot overwrite virtue scores, execute shell commands, or invent missing evidence.</p></article></div>
